From: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath11k: request optional firmware directly

firmware-2.bin is optional and ath11k falls back to API 1 when it is
absent. Avoid waiting for the userspace firmware helper during probe.
Keep the existing path construction and API 1 fallback unchanged.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/ath11k/20260910071838.1983652-1-julius@bairaktaris.de/
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/fw.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/fw.c
@@ -16,10 +16,11 @@ static int ath11k_fw_request_firmware_ap
 	struct ath11k_fw_ie *hdr;
 	const u8 *data;
 	__le32 *timestamp;
+	char path[100];
 
-	ab->fw.fw = ath11k_core_firmware_request(ab, name);
-	if (IS_ERR(ab->fw.fw)) {
-		ret = PTR_ERR(ab->fw.fw);
+	ath11k_core_create_firmware_path(ab, name, path, sizeof(path));
+	ret = request_firmware_direct(&ab->fw.fw, path, ab->dev);
+	if (ret) {
 		ath11k_dbg(ab, ATH11K_DBG_BOOT, "failed to load %s: %d\n", name, ret);
 		ab->fw.fw = NULL;
 		return ret;
